<title>FRANCE: FRANCE'S SEITA BOOSTED BY H1 SALES.</title>
<headline>FRANCE'S SEITA BOOSTED BY H1 SALES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French tobacco group Seita were lifted on Thursday after the company reported a 4.6 percent rise in first half sales.</p>
<p>At 1105 GMT, Seita was up 3.46 percent at 176.50 francs while the CAC-40 was down 0.27 percent at 2916.05</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
